  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Migration Data and Coordination Mechanisms for Improved Migration Governance in Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The complexity of mixed migration involving Ethiopia and Ethiopians calls for a solid and well-rounded approach to migration governance, including the collection, processing and dissemination of migration data and related information on migration, so that the benefits of migration can be effectively harnessed and challenges addressed. The project aims to contribute to the Government of Ethiopia&apos;s efforts to improve migration governance and uphold migrants&apos; human rights, though strengthened migration coordination mechanisms and data management systems.</narrative>
  </description>
